{"server":"cn","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_02_end","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_02","title":"荣誉之人","storyCode":"IS-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"16b9999846b472218cde5c1867749ba4e1247db96fdc7bbc93d37f899a28dc56","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"面对眼下的情况，莱昂图索决定暂时隐忍。德克萨斯接受审讯。拉普兰德接到了来自父亲的电话，但她还有别的想法。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你终于醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......家里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德米特，你怎么在这？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是拉维妮娅小姐把你送回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据医生的诊断，你是因为心力交瘁加上受伤，所以昏倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃苹果吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就知道你想吃，已经给你削好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她把你交给护卫就走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也知道，她向来是不愿意踏入这间宅邸的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了你来一趟已经是奇迹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇的死，确实是个不小的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你受伤的消息肯定也传出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，从其他家族的视角看，贝洛内家一瞬间从稳操胜券变成了内忧外患的状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随时都可能有人来咬我们一口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"袭击我的那帮人，有没有留下活口？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且他们的尸体上也没有留下任何线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得会是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卢佐一直没有出手，他们是在等待时机，这对他们来说，显然是一个好机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗塞蒂......虽然瓦拉赫跟我一起遇袭，他们似乎也是受害者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是哥伦比亚家族从来都不是铁板一块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，他们起内讧的可能性是存在的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，也不是没有别的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，真是挑了个好时机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我倒点水吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙，躺在床上倒是比平时还会发号施令。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你就一定要端一杯开水给我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是该怪你下达的命令不够准确呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，你总是用这种方法来表达不满，这次又是什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对德克萨斯的安排，我没法同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅是个公正的人，她不会诬陷任何一个清白的人，她有她的考虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我是说，她原本应该成为你的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领既然把她交给你，就有她不会危害家族的把握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该把她打造成一把利器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而现在，她却被拉维妮娅关了起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别告诉我，你看不出她也是为了我们家族考虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我承认，在如今这么危险的情况下，还握着德克萨斯这颗烫手山芋，会让你的处境更加岌岌可危。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的姓氏再度在叙拉古的土地上出现......实在是太惹眼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，以拉维妮娅的立场，德克萨斯握在她的手上会更加安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们家族内部的人，他们会怎么想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会觉得，你，贝洛内家的大少爷莱昂图索，已经太沉迷于在桌布上过家家的游戏，你变得软弱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至用不好一把刀，还丢失了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝洛内家已经落入下风，不论想找麻烦的是谁，我们都应该强硬地回击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂，沃尔西尼的新城区不光是你在的建设部的什么无聊“事业”，它该属于贝洛内家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以这才是你的真心话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有我的考虑，德米特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愿闻其详。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，你是我最好的兄弟，也是我的顾问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在遇袭的时候我就感觉到有些不对了，在听到卡拉奇死后，我就更加明确了这个想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才问我觉得是谁下的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实际上我不觉得是萨卢佐或者罗塞蒂的人干的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下手的人太了解我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他知道怎么样才能快速而且精确地打击到贝洛内，同时也能打击到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来几天，我会闭门不出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要好好养伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别人认为我们乱了阵脚，那就让他们继续这么认为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到真正的对手自己露出尾巴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你是故意放任拉维妮娅带走德克萨斯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于她想怎么用这张牌，交给她自己决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间，肯定会有不少针对我们家族的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你多注意调查背后都是谁在捣鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这个答案，能让你满意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你有明确的想法，那我自然会去执行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，你才是这里的老大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还差不多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别让我失望啊，德米特。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":true,"text":"喂，瓦拉赫，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂，我听说你受伤不轻，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于白天发生的事，我们需要聊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......你也有要问我的事，有关那个名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......“德克萨斯”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomB"},{"type":"narration","text":"沃尔西尼监狱"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你当时被拖住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个拖住你的人是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个旧识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旧识？在这个时候出现的旧识？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很适应这种场合，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在龙门，我偶尔也会接受这样的盘问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，我没有必要这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......每一个犯人都是这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实际上，我相信你并不是凶手，切利尼娜小姐。我实在难以想象做这件事对你有任何好处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，莱昂联系过我，他说，出于某些原因，你是可以信任的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原来如此，你出现在了那么多名流都在场的地方，那本就是贝洛内家给你准备的舞台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，在如今这样的情况下，将你放在我这边，才是最好的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在保护莱昂图索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是在保护你，德克萨斯小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......这样或许能分散些其他家族的注意力，他们会猜测贝洛内家族在被如此打击之后，到底会作何打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种忌惮......或许能让我更好地放开手脚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的是法官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么这么问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来非常了解家族是如何运作的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我确实是一名法官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在叙拉古，想要做好我的职业，我就必须要比家族成员们更了解，他们是如何生存的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我根本不想了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你理解错了，我的意思是，身为执法者，对执法对象有所了解是理所当然的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反而是过去的叙拉古，我从没听说过存在这样的法官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要搞错了，切利尼娜·德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不是因为所谓家族之间的制衡而将你带了过来。外人或许会这么判断我的立场，我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚来到这座城市，你还不明白，卡拉奇部长究竟有多么重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是一个非常值得尊重的人。他原本可以将正在建造中的新城市变得更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅仅是工业上的建设，他想让市民们有可能过上另一种生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而他现在死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要找出凶手，将他绳之以法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们自以为可以除掉一个又一个不听从他们命令的傀儡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我会让他们知道，他们除掉的不是一个个傀儡，而是一个个活生生的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":true,"text":"所以，卡拉奇的死，和你无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":true,"text":"而且你也没有发现凶手是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":true,"text":"而我交给你的任务，查探贝洛内把德克萨斯找来究竟想要干什么你也没有头绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您果然算无遗策，我亲爱的父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":true,"text":"而你在什么都没有做到的情况下，还没有在我召集会议的时候赶回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个季节，路上有点堵车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":true,"text":"拉普兰德，我在七年前把你逐出家门，你不再拥有萨卢佐这个姓氏，你知道这意味着什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然知道，这意味着您在想要除掉我这个不听话的工具时，不会再手软。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你总是很有自知之明，但你似乎并没有做出与你的自知之明相符合的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是给那个可怜的小法官一点警告而已，真的需要我去做吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......为什么我会想要去警告那个法官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然那位大少爷闭门不出，那么，那个放出狠话的小法官自然会被认为是贝洛内的代表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而以您的性格，必然不会就这么相信贝洛内真的就那么示弱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，用那个法官的安危试探一下贝洛内的深浅不是理所当然的事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":true,"text":"既然你知道该怎么做，我要看到成果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然不会违背您的命令，前提是，您想要的和我一致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最最亲爱的父亲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"萨尔瓦多雷！我们该怎么办！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"我该感谢你把我从血亲的控制中解脱出来吗？我该感谢你为了那些感染者劳工们能吃饱肚子而不惜沾上鲜血吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"你杀死的人是我的父亲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不需要向我陈述他的罪恶，我比你更清楚。你我身上的这些伤痕，正来源于他的施暴。那些劳工的死，正来源于他的盘剥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，可是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"萨尔瓦多雷，我真心实意地感谢你，你救了我，或许还救了很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，你身上的血腥味正越来越浓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"我们，我们离开这里吧，萨尔瓦多雷，带我去一个......带我去一个能获得平静的地方，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"或许已经太晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"萨尔瓦多雷，或许当你来到哥伦比亚的第一天，或许当你第一次打磨自己的那把小刀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"这一切都已经注定发生，不可挽回了，是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想，如果我是这位薇薇安，我会原谅萨尔瓦多雷吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"即使能够原谅，这种芥蒂也会伴随着两个人一辈子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说得完全正确，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两个人最后结合在了一起，当然是一种艺术加工处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事实上，真正的萨尔瓦多雷，并没有和那位薇薇安女士结合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，薇薇安的父亲虽然确实为富不仁，他却对自己的家人照顾有加，尤其是将薇薇安视作自己的掌上明珠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并没有那么多纯粹的恶人，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，即使那是自己深爱的人，即使自己的父亲确实作恶多端，这也并不是轻易就能原谅的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安女士，最后选择离开萨尔瓦多雷，前往另外一座城市，并在那里邂逅了一个真正爱她的人，开始了新的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，终她一生，她都没有忘记萨尔瓦多雷这个男人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，某种意义上，这个故事，也算是帮她圆梦吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"你很了解......薇薇安女士吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫卡特琳娜，美丽的演员小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是新来的演员吗？我常常会来这里，似乎以前并没有见过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我叫空，来自龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门？真有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说去龙门发展的演员有不少，像你这样从龙门来的，倒是很少见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"有的时候，逆潮流也有逆潮流的好处嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这我倒是同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特琳娜小姐，关于这位薇薇安女士，您知道现实中她后来怎么样了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安......薇薇安她啊，她一直没有忘记萨尔瓦多雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是这个原因吧，她的儿子，也走上了和萨尔瓦多雷相似的道路——成了家族的一员，并一步一步成了某个家族的领袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这个家族，在后来与萨尔瓦多雷产生了冲突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所幸，有薇薇安出面，他们两人并没有变成你死我活的关系，反而最终结成了盟友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说，就是剧本中的罗塞蒂家族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全正确，你已经把剧本都读过了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......出于一些个人的原因，我也想尽可能地了解德克萨斯这个家族的过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得这个故事，怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"我......有一些无法认可的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？比如？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"比如萨尔瓦多雷的孙女......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"空，造型师让你来看看衣服的设计！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我先失陪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，我们还会有再见的机会的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"空——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别着急，我们以后还可以慢慢聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......萨尔瓦多雷的孙女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又在剧院里浪费时间了，首领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过很多次了，瓦拉赫，这不是浪费时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了写一个破剧本，把大部分杂事丢给我，这也是一个家族领袖该做的事？你还给自己起了个叫卡特琳娜的假名？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有意见？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢。您毕竟是乔万娜·罗塞蒂，我最敬爱的首领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白你的不满。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座城市里，有什么值得我操心的事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前没有，现在有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，卡拉奇原本就是其他家族们为了互相制衡而推上去的普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他死了，说明贝洛内能力不足，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个长得很像切利尼娜的人突然出现在了莱昂图索身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，切利尼娜·德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦拉赫，我记得你应该不是个喜欢开玩笑的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你应该也知道，我最讨厌开德克萨斯玩笑的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我并没有在开玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝洛内不知道用什么办法找来了这个人。那显眼的发色......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你那张合照上的人一模一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她没死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她跟在莱昂图索身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年的清算，如果不是某个家族把她保下来，她绝无可能活下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果保下她的是贝洛内，倒也说得通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，得找贝洛内谈一谈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔万娜，这显然是他们的陷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对不起，首领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与其说是陷阱，不如说是阳谋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大度点，瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果当年真的是贝洛内保下了切利尼娜，我就算登门拜访向他们道谢又有何妨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准备一下吧，“谈生意”结束了，我要来造访沃尔西尼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了，我会去安排的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，看来，新剧本要稍微搁置一段时间了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领，你明明知道卡拉奇的死对我们来说是个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你却依然关心着德克萨斯这个姓氏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样下去，罗塞蒂是没有未来的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]}]}
